/-!
# A319135

Irregular triangle read by rows in which row n lists the positive divisors of n that are <= sqrt(n) in decreasing order.

The 87 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

